key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643254} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ca40324-7fd6-5cb8-8ac7-b4bf4e3ce724" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643267}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643267} :answer-field/id #uuid "cfa096bb-414f-516b-b0b7-95c69922fe82" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643290}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "737d7d1c-f5cd-5e51-afdd-88d546df57e3" :question/problem "Find $AB,$ if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-5}}</td><td>{{field-6}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is $3\\times 1$ matrix and $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix.  \n\nThere is $1$ column in matrix $A$ and $1$ row in matrix $B$, so the product is well defined:\n\n$$\n{A}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{3\\times 2}\n$$\n\nComputing the product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot (-2) & 1\\cdot (-6) \\\\ 1\\cdot (-2) & 1\\cdot (-6) \\\\ 0\\cdot (-2) & 0\\cdot (-6)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -6 \\\\ -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643284 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "72f1fe8a-2797-51b3-85b8-ff5b18c7b8