/problem "If\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix},$</div>\n</div>\n\nfind $AB.$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 1$ matrix and $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere is $1$ column in $A$ and $1$ row in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication: \n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=(-1)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=(-1)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=(-1)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=(-1)\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$$\n\\displaystyle AB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643363 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29a05446-31b9-5849-85bd-30db65834d42" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643357} {:answer/id #uuid "51267bfe-a803-5a11-834a-f9b5bfcec270" :answer/type {:d