ed:\n\n$$\n{S}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{T}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={ST}_{3\\times 2}\n$$\n\nComputing the product, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ST & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot (-4) & 4\\cdot 4 \\\\ 1\\cdot (-4) & 1\\cdot 4 \\\\ 2\\cdot (-4) & 2\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-16 & 16 \\\\ -4 & 4 \\\\ -8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186644105 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "217ad465-1a14-5d9a-a3ae-88eddf60cc3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643578} {:answer/id #uuid "288f11f9-5b41-5dc6-8419-78b4c703bb1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643587} {:answer/id #uuid "375e6a76-76f9-5cc0-9924-b2fd24e66423" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643613} {:answer/id #uuid "9a6cd715-a8b9-59f5-bad1-a206ffd4c066" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643784} {:answer/id #uuid "a4a93407-a28e-5693-a331-72b91dc7377a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ -1 & 6 & 16 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643798}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643578} :answer-field/id #uuid "dd345cdd-6499-5d30-82ec-d3bde63a21bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186644054}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "680b34ac-aafd-5a43-a4df-d97212cc408d" :question/math-academy-id "q-130655" :question/problem "If $J=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$, then ${J}^{3}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we compute ${J}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{J}^{2} & =J\\cdot J \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =J\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that ${J}^{2}=U,$ so $J$ is an idempotent matrix.\n\nWe can use this fact to compute ${J}^{3}$ quickly, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{J}^{3} & ={J}^{2}\\cdot J \\\\  & =J\\cdot J \\\\  & ={J}^{2} \\\\  & =J\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{J}^{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186644115 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a621344-e775-5662-b420-1b811728a05a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643560} {:answer/id #uuid "1fd7996a-b4f0-56e0-96c3-05ac1c9ed925" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643572} {:answer/id #uuid "2bdb966c-49ca-5190-b5c9-124bf9b54f45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643596} {:answer/id #uuid "8aa46772-83f8-5ca8-9615-cb3b5c7a62c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643759} {:answer/id #uuid "c9b73663-ced2-5111-be02-3fa7c3990e29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643875}] :answer